    "detailed_description": "<strong>Mission Andromeda - Escape from Earth </strong> is a sci-fi themed roguelite 2D shooter. The action takes place over various procedural levels of gradually increasing size. <br>Fly your Mining spaceship 'Mole-1' across the Galaxy and gather Ores and Biomass from different planets. Stop off along the way at space-stations and trade your Ores with the local Aliens for various upgrades to your ship and personal equipment. <br>Entering Deep-space will trigger random events where your choices will steer the outcomes.<br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedural Level generation</li><li>Permadeath</li><li>Jetpack Physics</li><li>3 planet types</li><li>Over 10 features to upgrade</li><li>Random Events</li></ul>",
